; The online leaderboards' access key (docs/online.md). Copy this file to online/talo.cfg (git
; ignores it: never commit a key) and paste the Game API key from the Talo dashboard
; (API keys page; scopes: Players read and write, Leaderboards read and write).
; The builds pack online/talo.cfg (export_presets.cfg > include_filter). Without it, or with an
; empty key, the game is offline: no leaderboards, no error. The environment variable
; TALO_ACCESS_KEY, when set, is used instead (a CI writes this file from it before exporting).

[talo]
access_key=""
; Only for a self-hosted Talo:
; api_url="https://api.trytalo.com"
